cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the APW4 research record and associated software artifacts, please cite this repository."
title: "The APW4 Energy–Incidence Argument and Its Lean 4 Formalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lubuimi"
    given-names: "Ta-Yoshua"
abstract: >-
  Research record for the APW4 energy–incidence argument and its associated
  Lean 4 artifacts. The mathematical dossier records diagonal transport,
  off-diagonal transport, and the strict energy lower-bound result as
  established. The repository contains declaration-scoped Lean verification
  artifacts; the citation does not imply that every historical APW4 proof
  component has been formalized in Lean.
